      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Code's Path**\n\nI'm solidifying the architecture for `extract_json.py`. I've settled on Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the external LLM provider, ensuring it's clearly referenced in the codebase.\n\n\n**Outlining the Implementation**\n\nI've mapped out the essential steps for `extract_json.py`. The plan includes using Vertex AI's `gemini-pro` and handling the input and output. I will implement a function, `extract_json_from_text`, to manage the LLM interaction with the text, which includes importing necessary packages such as `vertexai`.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820327141,
          "start": 1789820324344
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b99ac9f8001lHonJB62REaLci",
      "message_id": "msg_0b99ac54a001SMBmuQtyVGEZTt",
      "session_id": "ses_f46653acbffehVcJHuPnTgUdCG",
